# DOS Footer Standard

For DOS, COS, BOS, Micah, and client website builds:

- Do not use "AI Powered", "Powered by AI", or "Built with AI" in footer branding.
- If powered-by branding is needed, use exactly "Powered by DOS".
- Use this footer copyright format exactly:
  `© 2026 DOS — Directive Operating Systems Pty Ltd. All rights reserved.`
- Keep footer typography subtle, clean, professional, and premium.
- Keep spacing tight near "All rights reserved."
- Do not make footer text oversized or add glowing effects to footer text.
- Do not change footer layout unless required, and preserve mobile responsiveness.
